{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《香港系列之細間始終你好》第10集跟隨主持阮兆祥的腳步，走訪香港街頭巷尾的三間特色小店，發掘城市中的堅持與人情味。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>半世紀活字印刷廠：昇洪印刷廠</strong> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">位於九龍灣的昇洪印刷廠由梁國洪先生於1973年創立，見證了香港印刷業的黃金年代。廠內保存了1958年出產的半自動型活字印刷機，以及現已停產的香港製造「達明牌」半自動印刷機。廠內存有逾十噸字粒，涵蓋楷書、老宋、仿宋及黑體四種字體。排版過程全憑師傅的眼力與經驗執字粒。為了讓機器持續運作並傳承這項工藝，梁先生與第二代接班人Jacky開設工作坊及導賞團，將傳統印刷技術帶給下一代。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>營業時間：</strong> 留意社交平台公布</p></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ff94c9d8-5e8f-4408-af84-3af62da75851.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026BNappvgxC21787563740.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ff94c9d8-5e8f-4408-af84-3af62da75851.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"70258d59-e984-4911-9652-7b0e8a3fda95.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026GNybt6NQbM1787563740.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"70258d59-e984-4911-9652-7b0e8a3fda95.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>溫馨融合菜西餐館：張三</strong> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隱身於西營盤的「張三」由張氏一家合力經營。女兒阿Wing為了完成曾任酒店大廚的爸爸開餐廳的夢想，因而創立小館。店內招牌菜「京蔥鴨腿醬油手工意粉」將中式滷水風味結合西式慢煮技術，配上阿Wing親自鑽研、充滿蛋香的彈牙手工意粉，極具心思。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a5b36c06-a822-4a92-9866-f7adf8f6228a.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026hoctshWpHZ1787563741.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a5b36c06-a822-4a92-9866-f7adf8f6228a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"294f5e02-eb3e-4c2c-b387-30ace402044e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026sU4NCkdPyN1787563741.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"294f5e02-eb3e-4c2c-b387-30ace402044e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>環保裸買雜貨店：日常豐作</strong> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">店主Ann於六年前開設「日常豐作」，積極推廣自備容器及無包裝買嘢的減廢理念。店內售賣本地農場直送的無農藥蔬果以減少碳排放，並提供「牙膏粒」等無包裝個人清潔用品。若顧客忘記帶容器，店內亦有二手信封供使用，將環保融入生活細節。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1922bdb6-f2f7-4a74-abc0-54a3ea1f3ab6.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026yKOZ5LLgS41787563740.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1922bdb6-f2f7-4a74-abc0-54a3ea1f3ab6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1fdd43a7-1ba9-451f-b37b-1d5e6d55b0a7.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026rd92qycJoe1787563740.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1fdd43a7-1ba9-451f-b37b-1d5e6d55b0a7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T13:38:32.711208+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":530,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}